<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms buy 52,500 tonnes Canadian wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms buy 52,500 tonnes Canadian wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean buyers group, known as the Big Feed Mills, bought 52,500 tonnes of Canadian feed wheat at $137 a tonne C&amp;F from Daewoo Corp, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Traders said the purchase was made through a private negotiation late Wednesday.</p>
<p>Shipment was set for July 27-August 15 to the western ports of Inchon and Kunsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
